<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <title>Verifikasi email Anda</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f6f7f9;">
    <!-- Preheader: inbox preview text, invisible in the opened email. -->
    <span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;">
      Verifikasi alamat email Anda untuk mengaktifkan akses ke System Console.
    </span>
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f6f7f9;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:40px 16px;">
          <table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:560px;max-width:100%;">
            <tr>
              <td style="background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde0ec;border-radius:16px;padding:36px 40px;font-family:'Manrope','Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td width="40" height="40" style="width:40px;height:40px;background-color:#3f6fa8;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;font-family:'Manrope','Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#f6f7f9;">E</td>
                    <td style="padding-left:12px;font-family:'Manrope','Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                      <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#0e2748;">EDC Management</p>
                      <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#8593ad;">System Console</p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <p style="margin:30px 0 10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#3f6fa8;">Verifikasi email</p>
                <h1 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:23px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:#0e2748;">Aktifkan akses konsol Anda</h1>

                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#47618b;">Halo <strong style="color:#0e2748;">{{name}}</strong>,</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#47618b;">
                  Akun Anda di EDC Management sudah dibuat. Verifikasi alamat email ini
                  untuk mengaktifkan akses Anda ke System Console.
                </p>

                <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:24px 0 28px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="background-color:#3f6fa8;border-radius:10px;">
                      <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 30px;font-family:'Manrope','Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Verifikasi Email &rarr;</a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;color:#8593ad;">Tombol tidak berfungsi? Salin dan buka tautan berikut di browser Anda:</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 24px;padding:12px 14px;background-color:#f6f7f9;border:1px solid #dde0ec;border-radius:10px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;word-break:break-all;">
                  <a href="{{url}}" target="_blank" style="color:#345d8d;text-decoration:underline;">{{url}}</a>
                </p>

                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="background-color:#edeff6;border:1px solid #dde0ec;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;font-family:'Manrope','Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                      <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#3f6fa8;">Tautan berlaku 1 jam</p>
                      <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#47618b;">
                        Jika tautan sudah kedaluwarsa, coba masuk kembali di halaman login
                        &mdash; tautan verifikasi baru akan dikirim otomatis. Jika Anda
                        merasa tidak memiliki akun ini, abaikan email ini.
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding:24px 8px 0;font-family:'Manrope','Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#8593ad;">EDC Management &middot; System Console</p>
                <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#a5b0c6;">Email otomatis dari sistem &mdash; mohon tidak membalas email ini.</p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
